text = "LEVEL EDITOR

Tile Selection:
1 - Wall (Gray)
2 - Coin (Yellow) 
3 - Spike (Red)
4 - Player Spawn (Green)
5 - Goal (Blue)
6 - Eraser
9 - Waypoint (Path)

Mouse Controls:
- Left Click: Place tile
- Left Drag: Paint tiles
- Right Click/Drag: Erase
- Shift+Left Click: Start beat guide
- Shift+Right Click: Clear guides

Commands:
- Ctrl+S: Save to test_levels.txt
- L: Test in main game
- C: Clear all
- N: Change level size

Camera:
- Arrow Keys: Move camera

Waypoints:
- Auto-increments (a-z)
- Delete only most recent
- Shows perfect path"
